# The applier parks an entry but never answers its delivery.
MODULE: EveryEntryAcknowledgedParkUnacknowledged
TARGET: EveryEntryAcknowledged
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a parked entry is never acknowledged
PERTURBS: Settle

--- FIND
       ELSE /\ parked' = parked \cup {cur}
            /\ Acknowledge(cur)
--- REPLACE
       ELSE /\ parked' = parked \cup {cur}
            /\ rphase' = "Idle" /\ cur' = 0
            /\ UNCHANGED <<sstate, fails>>
--- END